@*  INJ-05 Defect Entry user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">INJ-05 · DEFECT</div>
        <div class="help-sub">불량 등록 — 코드 카드 선택 + 수량 입력</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="34" y="40">INJ-05 · STATION · LINE</text>

            @* ① rate banner *@
            <rect class="hs-region bad" x="14" y="68" width="692" height="60" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88">DEFECT RATE TODAY</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="28" y="116" style="font-size:24px;" fill="#fca5a5">2.1%</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="660" y="110" text-anchor="end">target ≤ 5%</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            @* ② Defect code grid 6 cards *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="140" width="692" height="216" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="160">▼ DEFECT CODE  ·  6 cards</text>
            @for (var i = 0; i < 6; i++)
            {
                var col = i % 3; var row = i / 3;
                var x = 36 + col * 224; var y = 176 + row * 84;
                var sel = i == 1;
                <g>
                    <rect class="hs-region @(sel ? "warn" : "")" x="@x" y="@y" width="200" height="68" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(x+14)" y="@(y+22)">INJ-D0@(i+1)</text>
                    <text class="hs-label" x="@(x+14)" y="@(y+48)" style="font-size:14px;">@(new[]{"Short Shot","Burn Mark","Sink Mark","Flash","Crack","Warpage"}[i])</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="150" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="150">2</text>

            @* ③ Qty + Save *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="368" width="430" height="50" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="392">DEFECT QTY</text>
            <rect x="160" y="378" width="140" height="32" rx="6" fill="rgba(0,0,0,.4)" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,.3)" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="230" y="400" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:18px;">2</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="378" r="13" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="378">3</text>

            <rect class="hs-region bad" x="458" y="368" width="248" height="50" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="582" y="400" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:18px;">⚠ REGISTER DEFECT</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="468" cy="378" r="13" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="468" y="378">4</text>

            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="360" y="450" text-anchor="middle">▶ INJ-02 · 04 · ... · LOGOUT</text>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ READ THE SCREEN · 화면 읽기</div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step bad">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Today's defect rate vs the 5% limit. Red banner when ≥ 5%.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">금일 불량률 + 5% 한계선. 5% 이상 빨강 경고.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step warn">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">6 defect-code cards. Tap one to select — selected card highlighted.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">6개 불량 코드 카드. 선택 시 강조 표시.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Defect qty. Must be ≥ 1.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">불량 수량 (1 이상).</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step bad">
                <div class="help-step-num">4</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">REGISTER writes PR_DefectDetail and updates the rate gauge on INJ-02.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">등록 시 PR_DefectDetail 기록 + INJ-02 게이지 갱신.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-callout warn">
            <div class="help-callout-i">⚠</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <strong>Defect rate ≥ 5%</strong> automatically suggests pausing the line. Talk to your shift leader before continuing.<br/>
                <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);">불량률 5% 이상 → 라인 일시정지 권장. 반장 상의 후 진행.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
